로 나눈 몫 A=5a-4b, B=6a-10b를 각각 구하고 합 A+B=11a-14b 산출 (2단계 서술형)","sourceTextExcerpt":"두 식 $A, B$가 다음과 같을 때, $A+B$를 계산하여라. [5점] $A = (16a^{2}b - 20a^{3}) \\div (-4a^{2})$, $B = (9a^{2} - 15ab) \\div \\frac{3}{2}a$","solutionDecisiveExcerpt":"A=5a-4b, B=6a-10b이므로 A+B=11a-14b이다.","visualAssetChecked":false,"visualType":"NONE"},{"questionId":23,"standardCourse":"중2 수학","standardUnitKey":"M2-02","standardUnit":"일차부등식","subUnitKey":"M2-02-LINEAR_INEQUALITY","subUnit":"일차부등식","problemTypeKey":"PT_LINEAR_INEQUALITY_SOLUTION","templateKey":"TPL_DISTRIBUTIVE_LINEAR_INEQUALITY_SOLUTION","crossConceptKeys":["CC_LINEAR_INEQUALITY_SOLUTION"],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"NONE","difficultyBucket":1,"difficultyConfidence":"rule_inferred","difficultyReason":"괄호 전개 후 일차부등식 -3x < 1을 풀어 x > -1/3 산출 (1단계 서술형)","sourceTextExcerpt":"일차부등식 $3(2-x) < 7$를 풀어라. [5점]","solutionDecisiveExcerpt":"6 - 3x < 7에서 -3x < 1이므로 x > -1/3이다.","visualAssetChecked":false,"visualType":"NONE"},{"questionId":24,"standardCourse":"중2 수학","standardUnitKey":"M2-02","standardUnit":"일차부등식","subUnitKey":"M2-02-INEQUALITY_APPLICATION","subUnit":"일차부등식의 활용","problemTypeKey":"PT_INEQUALITY_WORD_PROBLEM","templateKey":"TPL_SUBSCRIPTION_VS_PURCHASE_BREAKEVEN","crossConceptKeys":["CC_COST_COMPARISON_INEQUALITY","CC_WORD_PROBLEM_MODELING"],"conditionKeys":[],"integrationPattern":"SEQUENTIAL","difficultyBucket":2,"difficultyConfidence":"rule_inferred","difficultyReason":"구입 비용 240000+6000x < 대여 비용 9000x 부등식을 세워 x>80에서 81개월 산출 (2단계 서술형)","sourceTextExcerpt":"정수기 구입비용(240,000원 + 월 6,000원)과 대여비용(월 9,000원)을 비교할 때, 구입이 더 저렴해지는 시점은? [5점]","solutionDecisiveExcerpt":"240000 + 6000x < 9000x에서 3000x > 240000, x > 80이므로 81개월부터이다.","visualAssetChecked":false,"visualType":"NONE"}]}